# Frontend Rules

## Component Architecture
- Server Components by default (no 'use client' unless needed)
- Add 'use client' for: event handlers, hooks, browser APIs, zustand
- Thin page.tsx files — import from features/

## UI Components
- Always use components from `src/components/ui/index.tsx`
- Use `cn()` for conditional class merging
- Never hardcode colors — use Tailwind utilities

## Required States
Every data-fetching component must handle:
1. Loading state — use Skeleton component
2. Empty state — use EmptyState component  
3. Error state — show error message + retry button

## Design System (from DESIGN.md)
- Primary: `bg-indigo-600` / `text-indigo-600`
- Cards: `bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm p-6`
- Buttons: Use Button component from UI (not raw buttons for CTAs)
- Border radius: `rounded-xl` for inputs, `rounded-2xl` for cards

## Accessibility
- All icon-only buttons must have `aria-label`
- All interactive elements must have visible focus rings
- Use semantic HTML (button vs div, nav, main, header)
- Min touch target: 44×44px

## Mobile First
- Test at 375px, 768px, 1280px
- Mobile hamburger menu in DashboardLayout (already implemented)
- Use responsive Tailwind prefixes: sm:, md:, lg:, xl:
